/*
Trainer overrides in Pokemon Showdown-compatible syntax.

Only trainers listed here override the existing C tables. A block starts with:
    === TRAINER_ID ===

Required trainer fields: Name, Class, Pic
Optional fields: Gender, Music, Items, Double Battle, AI

Pokemon use Showdown export syntax. Example:

=== TRAINER_YOUNGSTER_BEN ===
Name: BEN
Class: Youngster
Pic: Youngster
Gender: Male
Music: Male
Items: Super Potion
Double Battle: No
AI: Check Bad Move / Check Good Move

Rattata (M) @ Oran Berry
Level: 12
Ability: Random All
Nature: Jolly
IVs: 31 HP / 31 Atk / 31 Def / 31 SpA / 31 SpD / 31 Spe
EVs: 0 HP / 252 Atk / 0 Def / 0 SpA / 4 SpD / 252 Spe
Tera Type: Normal
- Tackle
- Quick Attack

Important CFRU limitation: Ability, Nature, per-stat IVs/EVs and Tera Type
require explicit moves for every Pokemon in that trainer's party.
*/
